#! START_SOURCE_HEADER CSV2 CSV2_4
# =====================================================================
# The following GUI line prompts for a file to be used as the source CSV file.
# The user input is stored in a macro, which is then used to define
# the dataset to be read.
# The dataset this mapping file was generated from was:
#! END_SOURCE_HEADER
#! START_WB_HEADER
DEFAULT_MACRO SourceDataset
INCLUDE [ if {{$(SourceDataset)} != ""} {                        \
 puts {DEFAULT_MACRO SourceDataset_CSV2_4 $(SourceDataset)}     \
 } ]
#! END_WB_HEADER
#! START_SOURCE_HEADER CSV2 CSV2_4
DEFAULT_MACRO SourceDataset_CSV2_4 $(SourceDataset_CSV2_7)
GUI MULTIFILE SourceDataset_CSV2_4 CSV/Compressed_CSV/TEXT_Files(*.csv;*.gz;*.txt)|*.csv;*.gz;*.txt|CSV_Files(*.csv)|*.csv|Compressed_CSV_Files(*.gz)|*.gz|Text_Files(*.txt)|*.txt|All_Files(*)|* Source CSV (Comma Separated Value) File(s):
